pe[BinLogEvent]`로 간주되어, 타입 힌트에 문제가 없을 것입니다.","turn_id":"turn_000004"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1693659445.65819,"event_index":3,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2d814-655e-452b-8511-017fd02c6d9a","source_parent_id":"8daf2567-7548-4931-a44c-8694fb9fc3cc","source_record_index":3,"text":"        self.__allowed_events_in_packet: FrozenSet[event.BinLogEvent] = frozenset(\n            [TableMapEvent, RotateEvent]).union(self.__allowed_events)\n\n타입 'frozenset[BinLogEvent]'이(가) 필요하나 대신 'frozenset[Type[TableMapEvent] | Type[RotateEvent] | str]'을(를) 얻었습니다 \n\n이런 오류가 뜨는데 이유가 뭘까?  TableMapEvent, RotateEvent 모두 아래와 같은 형식이야.\n\nclass RotateEvent(BinLogEvent):\n...\n\nclass TableMapEvent(BinLogEvent):\n...\n\n그리고 이건 BinLogEvent 클래스의 형태야.\nclass BinLogEvent(object):\n...","turn_id":"turn_000003"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["self.__allowed_events_in_packet: FrozenSet[event.BinLogEvent] = frozenset(\n            [TableMapEvent, RotateEvent]).union(self.__allowed_events)"],"item_id":"context_1","normalized_text":"`self.__allowed_events_in_packet` is annotated as `FrozenSet[event.BinLogEvent]` and assigned a frozenset containing `TableMapEvent` and `RotateEvent`, unioned with `self.__allowed_events`.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000003"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["타입 'frozenset[BinLogEvent]'이(가) 필요하나 대신 'frozenset[Type[TableMapEvent] | Type[RotateEvent] | str]'을(를) 얻었습니다"],"item_id":"context_2","normalized_text":"The type checker reports that `frozenset[BinLogEvent]` is required, but the expression has type `frozenset[Type[TableMapEvent] | Type[RotateEvent] | str]`.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000003"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["class RotateEvent(BinLogEvent):\n...","class TableMapEvent(BinLogEvent):\n..."],"item_id":"context_3","normalized_text":"`RotateEvent` and `TableMapEvent` are declared as subclasses of `BinLogEvent`.","source_roles":["user"],"so